# ============================================================
# REPRODUCIBILITY CHECKS
# ============================================================
#
# Purpose
# -------
# Compare the outputs generated by the analytical workflow
# against a fixed set of previously verified reference values.
#
# These checks are regression/reproducibility controls.
# They are NOT an external validation of the Bayesian model,
# UREH classification, or clustering solution.
#
# Expected values:
#   checks/expected_results.csv
#
# This script should be run AFTER R/13_build_spatial_results.R.
#
# ============================================================


